Package: vn-demo-provider
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: OTP_Provisioner demo <demo@localhost>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-glib-2.0, dbus, systemd
Description: trusted half of the OTP_Provisioner sandboxed-app demo
 Renders a synthetic camera (a bright blob moving over a gradient) into a
 sealed shared-memory ring, hands sandboxed apps a read-only descriptor of it
 over D-Bus (io.github.DetectInt.Demo) and scores the detections they report.
 It tells apps apart by their UID, from the registry the station writes.
